OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FAny early morning mist and fog
OL,6,Fpatches soon lifting with another
OL,7,Fprimarily sunny day with just a little
OL,8,Fwispy high cloud at times. Slightly
OL,9,Fbreezier than on Monday but
OL,10,Ftemperatures climbing higher and
OL,11,Fbecoming very warm by the afternoon.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FPlenty of evening sunshine
OL,14,Fand then dry overnight with prolonged
OL,15,Fclear periods and variable cloud.
OL,16,FStaying rather warm in urban areas but
OL,17,Fcooler in the countryside by dawn.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
